{"Title":"An Act to electrify the Haverhill line of the commuter rail","BillNumber":"H3459","DocketNumber":"HD2890","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AXV1","Name":"Andres X. Vargas","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AXV1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T10:45:16.38"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AXV1","Name":"Andres X. Vargas","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AXV1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T10:45:16.38"},{"Id":"RMH2","Name":"Ryan M. Hamilton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T17:50:16.1266667"},{"Id":"PMP0","Name":"Pavel Payano","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMP0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-02T15:04:04.3366667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"RMH2","Name":"Ryan M. Hamilton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RMH2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T17:30:58.207"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3459/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Vargas of Haverhill and Hamilton of Methuen, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3459) of Andres X. Vargas, Ryan M. Hamilton and Pavel M. Payano for legislation to direct the Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority to electrify the Haverhill line of the commuter rail system.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 7 of Chapter 21N of The General Laws, as appearing in the 2018 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting the following paragraph:\r\n\t\"(e)The Haverhill Commuter Rail Line of the Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority shall be electrified no later than December December 31st, 2030.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}